<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58972" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>striking, beating</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύχειρι
				σὺν κόπῳ</span> (Pauw for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτύπῳ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				23
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέρνων κόπους</span>
			(Seidler for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτύπους</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				794
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοπανισμός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>toil and trouble, suffering</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				210
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδροδάϊκτος κόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					132a
				</span></i>
			p.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1265
			</span></i>; <i>pain</i> of a disease, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				880
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπους παρέχειν τινί</span> to
			give <i>trouble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				26.10
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				21.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				844.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπον ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mus.</u>
					p.62
				</span></i>
			 K.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα κ. ἀναδεξάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					761
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				6
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fatigue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.190
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπου ὕπο</span> from <i>very
				weariness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				634
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπῳ παρεῖμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					852
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπῳ δαμέντες,
			ἁλίσκεσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				764
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ κ. ξυνεῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					321
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γόνατα κ. ἕλοι μου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					542
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				124
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόποι καὶ ὕπνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					537b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				6.5
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ κόπων</span> title of
			work by <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>work, exertion</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμάραν ἀφ᾽ ἱδίων κόπων ἐποίησεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).384
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>),  cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				884.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπῳ κόπον
			λύειν</span> prov. in <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.2.8
			</span></i>.</div>
